					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2255646#post-2830255</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2255646/scp-3099#post-2830255</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2017 16:18:35 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Lady de Selby</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3132313</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Not really sure why some people were confused about this one.</p> <p>It's been a bit since I first read it but I remember my interpretation being something like this:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>It's an entity that only exists in this video; because the video is a porn video, sex is the only thing it's ever learned, so that's the only way it can try to interact with the outside world. It &quot;reproduces&quot; by birthing itself into this world, but it's not really suited to surviving in it or escaping without damaging its host. This gives off a &quot;tragic animal&quot; sort of vibe to me.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
